{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"2c2b9182a2a756ce3b722d1a2bcfa6a31014c901","body":"The CLI currently loads Midnight SDK dependencies even when running local Core commands. Add a default-enabled `native` feature and an explicit `--no-default-features` configuration for Core inspection, simulation and project tests. Keep the full command schema and native defaults; commands needing native support return a typed capability error in the Core configuration.\n\nLocal validation: one offline cold build and all 12 selected integration tests passed in 63.06 seconds (`stage_test_public`, `core_test_report`, `logical_meter`). This exercises the actual binary, six full staged envelopes, large complete reports, 87 accepted FeePool cases and logical work caps. The build log contains no Midnight/backend/ledger compilation. Independent ordinary and designated security-fallback source/resource and actual-result reviews accepted this exact scope and merge tree.\n\nDefault/native and full workspace tests, formatting and Clippy remain unrun. The separate native availability test suite is pending. FeePool checks complete post-state/effects; the meter's full execution comparisons share the evaluator. This change does not qualify compilation, proofs or ledger acceptance.\n","closedAt":"2026-10-18T07:02:14Z","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-10-18T06:55:42Z","authors":[{"email":"charles.hoskinson@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzk5NTI=","login":"CharlesHoskinson","name":"Charles Hoskinson"}],"committedDate":"2026-10-18T06:55:42Z","messageBody":"Retain native defaults and full command schema. Add explicit SDK-free Core CLI configuration and early capability refusals. Source reviewed; selected runtime check pending.","messageHeadline":"Separate native CLI dependencies behind a default feature","oid":"3982d6a565fb0ea001213b79888bfe501a821e1c"}],"createdAt":"2026-10-18T06:57:35Z","files":[{"path":"RUST_GUIDELINES.md","additions":18,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/mori/Ca